Package: IsoEM
Type: Package
Title: EM-Based Transcript Quantification for Long-Read RNA-seq
Version: 0.3.5
Authors@R: person("hmutpw", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "hmutpw@github.com")
Description: Post-processes IsoQuant long-read RNA-seq output using
    equivalence-class (EC) compressed EM to produce statistically principled
    transcript-level counts. Provides a modular pipeline: prepare_isoem()
    validates input files; build_ec() / build_sc_ec() construct equivalence
    classes from bulk or single-cell data with UMI deduplication; run_em()
    performs vectorised EM quantification; write_isoem() / write_sc_isoem()
    write results to disk including EC tables and transcript sharing analysis.
    One-step wrappers run_isoem() and run_sc_isoem() are also provided.
    Designed for transposable element analysis and large spatial/single-cell
    datasets with memory-efficient chunk processing.
